[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u7D20\u6750\u304C\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u63A1\u308C\u305F\u306A\u3041\u3002\n\u3000\u65E9\u3044\u3046\u3061\u306B\u6574\u7406\u3057\u3061\u3083\u304A\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u82B1\u3073\u3089\u3068\u8449\u3001\u6839\u3063\u3053\u306F\u5206\u3051\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I gathered quite a lot of materials today.\nI should sort them out while I can.\nFlower petals, leaves, roots...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u308C\uFF1F\u3000\u4ECA\u3001\u3082\u305E\u3082\u305E\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Huh? Did something just wiggle...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3072\u3083\u3044\u3042\u3042\u3042\uFF5E\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u866B\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eeeeeek! A bug!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3060\u3088\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u6355\u307E\u3048\u305F\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don\u0027t worry, Resna! I caught it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3060\u3044\u307E\uFF5E\u3002\u5916\u306B\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3088\u3002\n\u5C11\u3057\u96E2\u308C\u305F\u6240\u3060\u304B\u3089\u623B\u3063\u3066\u3053\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m back! I let it go outside.\nIt was pretty far away, so it won\u0027t come back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u3001\u30A4\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I-Izana, thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u304F\u3089\u3044\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3061\u3087\u3044\u306E\u3061\u3087\u3044\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, that was nothing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3041\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\n\u5FC3\u306E\u5E95\u304B\u3089\u3042\u308A\u304C\u305F\u3044\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* I\u0027m just so grateful\nto have you by my side, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u3052\u3055\u3060\u3088\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re exaggerating!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\n\u4ED6\u306B\u306F\u3069\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308A\u304C\u305F\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So, what else are you grateful for?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3063\uFF1F\u3000\u6025\u306B\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u3042\u308A\u3059\u304E\u3066\u6DF7\u4E71\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3046\u306A\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? That\u0027s so sudden...\nThere\u0027s too many things, I\u0027m getting flustered!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3001\u305D\u3046\uFF1F\n\u3067\u3082\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u5F37\u3044\u3066\u8A00\u3046\u3068\u3057\u305F\u3089\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, really?\nBut if you had to pick one...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u91CD\u3044\u8377\u7269\u3092\u904B\u3093\u3067\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Carrying heavy things"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6301\u3066\u306A\u3044\u8377\u7269\u3092\u904B\u3093\u3067\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304B\u306A\uFF01\n\u3044\u3064\u3082\u300C\u91CD\u304F\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\u300D\u3063\u3066\n\u6C17\u9063\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Carrying things that are too heavy for me!\nYou\u0027re always asking \u0022Isn\u0027t that too heavy?\u0022\nand looking out for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3001\u6298\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3044\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3082\u3093\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u5927\u62B5\u306E\u8377\u7269\u306F\n\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3088\u308A\u8EFD\u3044\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you look like you might snap in half!\nBesides, most things are lighter\nthan my hammer anyway!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u4FEE\u884C\u306E\u5F79\u306B\u3082\u7ACB\u3064\u3057\u3001\n\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u91CD\u3044\u3082\u306E\u306F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u6301\u3064\u304B\u3089\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s good knight training too,\nso I\u0027ll keep carrying the heavy stuff!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u75B2\u308C\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306B\u5FDC\u63F4\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheering me up when I\u0027m tired"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u75B2\u308C\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306B\u5FDC\u63F4\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304B\u306A\uFF01\n\u8ABF\u5408\u3067\u75B2\u52B4\u56F0\u618A\u306E\u3068\u304D\u3001\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u58F0\u304C\u67D3\u307F\u308B\u3093\u3060\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you cheer me up when I\u0027m tired!\nWhen I\u0027m exhausted from synthesis,\nyour voice really lifts my spirits!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u30FC\uFF1F\u3000\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3044\u3044\u306E\uFF1F\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3060\u3063\u3066\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u306E\u6642\u9593\u306B\n\u7652\u3055\u308C\u3066\u308B\u306E\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eh? Is that enough?\nI\u0027m the one who feels healed\nwhen I spend time with you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u58F0\u3067\u5143\u6C17\u304C\u51FA\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u4E00\u5C64\u5143\u6C17\u3088\u304F\u51FA\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3068\u306D\uFF01\n\u3044\u3051\u3044\u3051\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if my voice gives you energy,\nI\u0027ll have to be even more energetic!\nGo, go, Resna!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E16\u9593\u3068\u306E\u6A4B\u6E21\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being my bridge to the world"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\u4E16\u9593\u3068\u306E\u6A4B\u6E21\u3057\u3060\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, being my bridge to the world!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306A\u3057\u3058\u3083\u3001\n\u4EBA\u4ED8\u304D\u5408\u3044\u304C\u2026\u2026\u305D\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Without you, dealing with people\nwould be... um..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u30FC\u306B\u3092\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u304B\u306A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you talking about!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u307E\u3067\u3082\u3001\u4F9D\u983C\u3092\u305F\u3063\u304F\u3055\u3093\n\u53D7\u3051\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3002\u81EA\u4FE1\u6301\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027ve taken on lots of requests already.\nHave more confidence!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3060\u3051\u3069\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u52C7\u6C17\u3092\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u9032\u3081\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! But it was because you were there\nthat I found the courage to move forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3063\u3066\u3070\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez, Resna..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3002\u307B\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3066\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u306A\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. It makes me happy to hear that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u306E\u53B3\u3057\u3044\u4FEE\u884C\u3092\n\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u3054\u8912\u7F8E\u3060\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s like a reward for all that harsh training\nwith Lila!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306D\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u4E00\u756A\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u306E\u306F\u2026\u2026\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u623B\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you know what makes me happiest of all...\nIt\u0027s that you came back to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304B\u3048\u308A\u306A\u3055\u3044\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome home, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u2026\u2026\u305F\u3060\u3044\u307E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... I\u0027m home!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306D\u3001\u3053\u306E\u5148\u3082\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\n\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3044\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308A\u305F\u304B\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted to become stronger\nso I could stay by your side, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3069\u3093\u306A\u653B\u3081\u65B9\u306B\u3082\u5BFE\u5FDC\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3001\n\u5BC6\u5EA6\u306E\u9AD8\u3044\u935B\u932C\u3092\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s why I trained intensively\nto handle any kind of attack."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u4E00\u76EE\u3067\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! I could tell right away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF01\uFF1F\u3000\u3088\u30FC\u3057\u3053\u308C\u3082\u805E\u3044\u3061\u3083\u3048\n\u3069\u3053\u304C\u4E00\u756A\u3059\u3054\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!? Well then, tell me\u2014\nWhat was the most impressive part!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7121\u99C4\u3092\u524A\u304E\u843D\u3057\u305F\u52D5\u304D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your refined movements!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7121\u99C4\u3092\u524A\u304E\u843D\u3057\u305F\u52D5\u304D\uFF01\n\u601D\u308F\u305A\u898B\u60DA\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u3082\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your refined movements!\nI couldn\u0027t help but stare in amazement!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u306B\u52A9\u8A00\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3002\n\u9699\u3092\u306A\u304F\u3059\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\u7121\u99C4\u306A\u52D5\u304D\u3092\n\u524A\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila gave me some advice.\nShe said to eliminate openings\nby cutting out unnecessary movements."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3057\u305F\u3089\u3001\u4F53\u529B\u306E\u914D\u5206\u304C\u4E0A\u624B\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\n\u524D\u3088\u308A\u9577\u304F\u52D5\u3051\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After that, I got better at managing my stamina\nand could keep going for longer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u307E\u3067\u306F\u4E00\u6253\u5165\u9B42\uFF01\u3000\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u767E\u6253\u5165\u9B42\u3060\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I used to think one powerful strike was enough,\nbut now I\u0027m aiming for a hundred!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3088\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u6700\u5F37\u3067\u3044\u3089\u308C\u308B\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Amazing! You\u0027ll be the strongest forever!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF12\u672C\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your dual hammers!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\uFF12\u672C\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3060\u3088\uFF01\n\u307E\u3055\u304B\u5897\u3048\u308B\u3068\u306F\u601D\u308F\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306A\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obviously, your dual hammers!\nI never expected you\u0027d add another one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF11\u672C\u3060\u3068\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u306E\u624B\u6570\u306B\u5BFE\u5FDC\u3067\u304D\u306A\u304F\u3066\n\u6094\u3057\u304F\u3063\u3066\u3055",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I couldn\u0027t keep up with Lila\u0027s attack speed\nwith just one, and it was so frustrating..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u6D41\u308C\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that\u0027s how it happened?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\uFF11\u672C\u3067\u3082\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\uFF12\u672C\u306A\u3089\u3082\u3063\u3068\u3059\u3054\u3044\u306E\u306F\u5F53\u7136\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, if one hammer was amazing,\ntwo must be even more amazing, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9244\u58C1\u306E\u69CB\u3048\u3060\u3088\uFF01\n\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\uFF13\u672C\u76EE\u306E\u69CB\u60F3\u3082\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s like an iron wall defense!\nWait, are you planning for a third one!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u6C7A\u3081\u3066\u308B\u3088\uFF01\n\u67C4\u306E\u5148\u306B\u4ED8\u3051\u3066\u3001\u4E21\u5263\u306A\u3089\u306C\u4E21\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve already decided!\nI\u0027ll attach it to the handle\u2014dual hammers instead of dual swords!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3063\u3001\u5922\u304C\u5E83\u304C\u308B\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, the possibilities are endless!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u63FA\u308B\u304E\u306A\u3044\u7CBE\u795E\u529B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your unwavering spirit!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u63FA\u308B\u304E\u306A\u3044\u7CBE\u795E\u529B\u3060\u3088\uFF01\n\u623B\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306E\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3001\n\u307E\u3063\u3059\u3050\u3067\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your unwavering spirit!\nWhen you came back, you looked so cool\nand determined..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3001\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3064\u3051\u3059\u304E\u3060\u3088\u3063\u3066\n\u8A00\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, didn\u0027t you say I was trying\ntoo hard to look cool?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3042\u306E\u6642\u306E\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u3001\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3078\u623B\u308B\u306A\u3089\n\u305D\u306E\u304F\u3089\u3044\u6C7A\u3081\u306A\u304D\u3083\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But back then, I thought I had to be\nat least that determined if I was going\nto return to your side."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u983C\u308C\u308B\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\u751F\u307E\u308C\u5909\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3063\u3066\n\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3092\u3001\u898B\u305B\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3057\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had to show you that I\u0027d become\na more reliable Izana!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u591C\u7A7A\u306E\u661F\u2026\u2026\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3002\n\u6E80\u5929\u306E\u661F\u304F\u3089\u3044\u8F1D\u3044\u3066\u305F\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were shining like the stars...\nNo, like the entire night sky!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u3044\u308B\u3068\n\u4F55\u3092\u8A71\u3057\u3066\u3082\u697D\u3057\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046\u306A\u3041",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe...!\nTalking with you always makes me\nso happy, no matter what we discuss!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3046\u6642\u9593\u306F\u4E45\u3057\u3076\u308A\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u306A\u304A\u3055\u3089\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s been a while since we\u0027ve had\ntime like this, hasn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026\u96E2\u308C\u3066\u308B\u9593\u306F\u3001\u5BC2\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... I felt so lonely while we were apart."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u3060\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u3060\u3088\u3002\n\u3044\u3064\u3082\u96A3\u306B\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\n\u3044\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3001\u3059\u3054\u304F\u82E6\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too.\nWithout you by my side,\nit was really hard..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u2026\u2026\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u3042\u308C\u3060\u3051\u8FF7\u3063\u3066\n\u6C7A\u3081\u305F\u306E\u306B\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u5FEB\u304F\u9001\u308A\u51FA\u305B\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3092\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u6094\u3084\u3093\u3067\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... even though you struggled so much\nwith that decision, I couldn\u0027t properly\nsee you off. I\u0027ve regretted that ever since."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3082\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306D\u3002\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306B\n\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u6C7A\u3081\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m sorry too. It was such an important decision,\nbut I made it all by myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3092\n\u5B88\u308A\u7D9A\u3051\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u306F\u3001\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I knew I had to become stronger\nto keep protecting you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u305A\u3063\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3044\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\n\u4ECA\u306F\u6211\u6162\u3057\u3066\u96E2\u308C\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I thought we had to be apart for a while,\nso we could be together forever after."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u4ECA\u306A\u3089\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3088\u3002\n\u79C1\u306F\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3092\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u308B\u3002\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u3051\u304C\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u69D8\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I understand now.\nI believe in you, Izana.\nYou\u0027re my one and only knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\uFF01\n\u305A\u3063\u3068\u305D\u3070\u3067\u5B88\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!\nI\u0027ll always be here to protect you, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8CA0\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I tried my best not to lose"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u3001\u8CA0\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u3088\u3002\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u306B\n\u3044\u3064\u307E\u3067\u3082\u3081\u305D\u3081\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3082\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I tried my best not to lose either.\nI couldn\u0027t keep moping around\nwhile you were working so hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2\u306B\u52B1\u307E\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3051\uFF1F\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30AF\u30E9\u30A6\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2\u306F\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u81EA\u8EAB\u306E\n\u529B\u3060\u3088\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u306A\n",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia encouraged you, right?\nBut she said it was all your own strength\nin the end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u4E00\u751F\u61F8\u547D\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3001\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re always so hardworking, it\u0027s really cool."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\n\u81EA\u6162\u306E\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re always my pride and joy, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30E1\u306B\u30D6\u30E9\u30B7\u306B\u8A71\u3057\u304B\u3051\u3066\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I talked to the brush regularly"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u2026\u2026\u30DE\u30E1\u306B\u30D6\u30E9\u30B7\u306B\u8A71\u3057\u304B\u3051\u3066\u305F\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... talked to the brush regularly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What do you mean!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u30D6\u30E9\u30B7\u306F\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\n\u4E00\u7DD2\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That brush was always with you,\nwasn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u540C\u3058\u304F\u3089\u3044\u3001\n\u5BC2\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u2015\u2015",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I thought maybe it was feeling\njust as lonely as I was\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3001\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3092\u5206\u304B\u3061\u5408\u3063\u3066\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I shared my feelings with it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u3001\u92FC\u9244\u306E\u9B42\u3092\u5206\u3051\u5408\u3063\u305F\u53CC\u5B50\u2026\u2026\n\u3044\u3084\u3001\u3082\u306F\u3084\u5206\u8EAB\u3068\u8A00\u3048\u308B\u304B\u3082\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed... like twins sharing a steel soul...\nNo, more like we\u0027re the same being!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3087\u3001\u5197\u8AC7\u3060\u3088\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I was just kidding!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u5B9F\u306F\u306D\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u3060\u3051\u4E0D\u5B89\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u4ECA\u306E\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3001\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u3044\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Actually, I was a bit worried.\nThe way you are now,\nmaybe you didn\u0027t need me anymore..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3044\u3088\uFF01\n\u6D41\u308C\u661F\u306B\u8A93\u3063\u305F\u65E5\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u305F\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3093\u3066\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u79C1\u306E\u7279\u5225\u306A\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s not true at all!\nI\u0027ve never forgotten our promise under the shooting star.\nYou\u0027ll always be special to me, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3002\n\u7D76\u5BFE\u3001\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u5922\u3092\u53F6\u3048\u3088\u3046\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Resna.\nLet\u0027s definitely make our dreams come true together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u308B\u3068\n\u3000\u5B89\u5FC3\u3059\u308B\u306A\u3042\u3002\u623B\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u672C\u5F53\u306B\n\u3000\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Having Izana by my side really puts me at ease.\nI\u0027m so glad she came back.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u305A\u3063\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\n\u3000\u3044\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3088\u306D\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We\u0027ll definitely be together forever now...\nright?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]